flowchart LR
    U[Signer] --> C[Browser camera]
    C -->|JPEG frames over WSS| API[FastAPI WebSocket on ECS]
    API --> CV[OpenCV 5\nDecode + resize]
    CV --> RTM[RTMPose + RTMDet\nONNXRuntime CPU]
    RTM --> L[Hand landmarks]
    L --> Q[Duplicate suppression\nleft/right assignment]
    Q --> R[Geometric finger rules\nT/I/M/R/P straight or bent]
    R --> M[Tamil fingerspelling mapping]
    M --> S[Stability timer\n350 ms + fist space]
    S --> T[Tamil Unicode text]
    T --> C

    D[TLFS23 dataset folders] --> EV[Offline evaluator]
    EV --> CSV[Per-image stage CSV\nmetrics + latency]
    EV -. same pipeline .-> CV

    ECR[Amazon ECR\nprivate image registry] --> F[Fargate task]
    F --> API
    ALB[Application Load Balancer\nHTTPS endpoint] --> F
    CW[CloudWatch Logs] <-- F
    IAM[IAM roles] --> F

